      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "THREE VOTES NICK (8) missed the frame last time but had been racing well prior to that, winning a Grade 5 three back before a placing at this track the following run. Has the ability and expected to go close. DUNACH FIREBALL (1) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing seventh (22.97) in a Grade 5 at this track. Has ability and is one of the better chances. SNOWBALL ONE (3) held a forward position from the pinch but began to paddle on the bend and drifted out of the finish when 7th at this track in Grade 5 company. Shapes as one to consider. KATE'S RIFT (2) should be thereabouts after filling a top-three spot most recently.",
